harness, lightning, improvement, security, project, career, dll) =
**prosedur terapan lewat MCP + skill progressive disclosure** — bukan
vendor tool, bukan file lokal. Paksa lewat `xninetzy_*` = capability +
memory + provenance + audit terjaga lintas session.

