### Lingkup Maximize

- 100+ skill terpasang di `~/.xninetzy/skills/`: xninetzy-academic-safety,
  xninetzy-assignment-orchestrator, xninetzy-deep-research, xninetzy-hebat,
  xninetzy-krs, xninetzy-learning-coach, xninetzy-mcp-lightning,
  xninetzy-memory, xninetzy-obsidian-orchestra, xninetzy-os,
  xninetzy-research-memory, xninetzy-security-testing, xninetzy-uacc,
  xninetzy-web-analysis, xninetzy-cyber-campus, academic-writer,
  academic-editor, anti-slop, claim-lattice, citation-validation,
  consultant, debugging, it-learning, memory-management, obsidian-knowledge,
