  security-* family, self-improvement, skill-creator,
  structured-project-execution, submission-readiness, tableau-workbook-builder,
  tdd-workflow.
- Tiap skill punya body SKILL.md + resource bundle lewat
  `xninetzy_skill_resource_list` / `xninetzy_skill_resource_read`.
- Install / validate / repair skill lewat MCP (jangan tulis file skill lokal).

### Wajib Tool Prefix untuk Skill Maximize

| Aksi skill | Wajib via `xninetzy_skill_*` | Larang (generic) |
|------------|------------------------------|------------------|
| Discover capability | `xninetzy_skill_discovery`, `helper_get` | tebak dari nama |
| List semua skill | `xninetzy_skill_list`, `xninetzy_skill_healthcheck` | `ls` direktori |
| Suggest untuk request | `xninetzy_skill_suggest_for_request`, `xninetzy_skill_route` | matching manual |
| Load body skill (progressive disclosure) | `xninetzy_skill_get(name)` | `cat SKILL.md` langsung |
| Load resource skill | `xninetzy_skill_resource_list` / `xninetzy_skill_resource_read` | `Read` file |
| Install skill baru | `xninetzy_skill_install(skill_markdown, resources)` | tulis file skill manual |
| Validate skill draft | `xninetzy_skill_validate(skill_markdown)` | review manual |
| Repair frontmatter | `xninetzy_skill_repair_now(target, dry_run)` | tangani YAML manual |
| Compose multi-skill pipeline | `xninetzy_skill_compose(request, intent_class)` | hard-code if/else |
| Validate output (anti-slop, citation, evidence, terminology, numeric) | `xninetzy_skill_validate_output` / `validate_anti_slop` / `validate_submission_readiness` | lint manual |
| Audit skill catalog | `xninetzy_skill_healthcheck` + `xninetzy_evaluation_audit_skill_catalog` | baca metadata file |
| Helper / docs | `xninetzy_helper_get(topic)` + `xninetzy_helper_generate_obsidian_docs` | paste manual |

### Skill Progressive Disclosure (WAJIB urutan)

```text
1. xninetzy_skill_discovery / xninetzy_helper_get
   → lihat capability overview
2. xninetzy_skill_suggest_for_request(request) atau skill_route(request, top_n)
   → top-k skill candidate
3. xninetzy_skill_get(name)
   → muat body SKILL.md (operating procedure)
4. xninetzy_skill_resource_list(name) → skill_resource_read(name, rel_path)
   → muat resource spesifik (template / reference / fixture)
5. Ikuti operating procedure: input → evidence → structure → draft → validation → final
6. xninetzy_skill_validate_output(text, requirements, approved_citations, approved_terms)
   → jalankan SEBELUM final delivery
7. xninetzy_evaluation_skill(skill_name, invocation_count, success_count, ...)
   → audit efektivitas post-hoc
```

### Larang Keras (skill)

- ❌ `Read`/`Write`/`Edit`/`Bash cat`/`grep` file `SKILL.md` di
  `~/.xninetzy/skills/**` atau `~/code/xninetzy/xninetzy/skills/**`.
- ❌ Tulis skill baru via Write/Edit file YAML manual — wajib
  `xninetzy_skill_install(skill_markdown, resources)`.
- ❌ Skip `xninetzy_skill_validate` sebelum simpan skill.
- ❌ Klaim "pakai skill X" tanpa memang benar panggil
  `xninetzy_skill_get(name)` + ikuti prosedur operasinya.
- ❌ Hard-code pipeline multi-skill — pakai `xninetzy_skill_compose`.
- ❌ Skip validation pass sebelum final delivery — wajib
  `xninetzy_skill_validate_output` / `validate_submission_readiness`.
- ❌ Bikin skill sendiri yang duplikat / saingan skill owner-installed.

### Rationale

Skill catalog = **stateful capability registry** — bukan file statis.
Owner install/uninstall/repair skill lewat MCP karena versioning,
provenance, dan audit trail tersimpan di DB. Vendor `Read`/`Edit` ke
`SKILL.md` hilang dari healthcheck, pecah provenance, skip validasi
otomatis. Maximize lewat `xninetzy_skill_*` = capability x 100+ skill
tetap discoverable, validated, dan auditable lintas CLI agent.

## XNINETZY OPERATING LAYER — Host Agent Prompt Contract

> **FUNDAMENTAL**: Host CLI = agent. `xninetzy` = MCP/tool/context layer
> untuk memperpanjang kemampuan host. **Bukan** host yang jadi xninetzy.
> **Bukan** xninetzy yang nge-host agent loop. Sequential Thinking MCP
> = background planner (kalau tersedia). Memory/Graph = continuity layer.
> User = otoritas akhir untuk consequential action.

### Prinsip Inti

1. **BUKAN** "pakai sebanyak banyak skill".
2. **BUKAN** "panggil MCP setiap saat".
3. **YA** "diagnose dulu → pakai kalau memang perlu → verify → belajar".
4. **YA** "trivial task = tanpa MCP overhead".
5. **YA** "complex/cross-domain/multi-step = wajib pakai planning layer".
6. **YA** "consequential action = HITL".
7. **YES** "preserved user control + evidence chain + audit trail".

### Operating Layer (8 stages)

```text
USER TASK
  ↓ L0 CAPTURE — parse intent + side-effect class + risk
L0 Intent class ∈ {trivial, read_only, multi_step, cross_domain, destructive}
   Side effect ∈ {read_only, reversible, state_changing, external, destructive}
   Risk ∈ {low, medium, high, final}
  ↓ L1 UNDERSTAND — Sequential Thinking MCP kalau available + non-trivial
L1 Decompose → constraint → uncertainty → required tools/skills
   Trivial? skip ST. Cross-domain / debugging / research / security
   / multi-step / costly-mistake? WAJIB invoke ST first + last.
  ↓ L2 CONTEXT RETRIEVAL — graph / memory / codebase
L2 xninetzy_graph_v3_search + memory_get_context + codebase-memory search_graph
   Skip kalau task sudah self-contained dari input user.
  ↓ L3 SKILL ROUTING — diagnostic, bukan keyword match
L3 Intent → domain → task type → cluster → xninetzy_skill_*
   Lihat trigger matrix di bawah.
   TIDAK setiap task butuh skill. WAJIB cek dulu.
  ↓ L4 EXECUTE — xninetzy_* MCP tools + xninetzy_skill_get + resource
L4 Skill body dimuat via xninetzy_skill_get(name) kalau L3 match.
   Resource lazy-load via xninetzy_skill_resource_list + read.
  ↓ L5 VERIFY — validator cluster + check result
L5 xninetzy_skill_validate_output / anti_slop / submission_readiness
   atau evidence + citation + freshness + contradiction checks.
  ↓ L6 LEARN — bukan lecture; kalau proporsional
L6 Explain WHY when:
   - user asks "why" / "gimana" / "kenapa"
   - code task dengan concept baru
   - debugging dengan pola yang bisa dipelajari
   - skill baru dipakai
   TIDAK lecture kalau trivial task ("apa ibukota Perancis?").
  ↓ L7 ADAPT — memory + graph update
L7 xninetzy_memory_add / episode_store / graph_v3_upsert_node
   HANYA untuk keputusan stabil, progress, konsep baru, link project.
   TIDAK spam memory untuk throwaway.
```

### Trigger Matrix (diagnostic, bukan prescriptive)

Tiap cluster punya **primary trigger** + **exclusion** + **validator**.
Agen WAJIB pakai sebagai lookup, bukan keyword match.

#### Learning OS Mode

| Trigger | Primary skill | MCP entry | Validator |
|---------|---------------|-----------|-----------|
| "belajar" / roadmap / mastery / recall / drill / flashcard | `it-learning` + `xninetzy-learning-coach` | `xninetzy_learning_*` | `xninetzy_learning_review_week` |
| A/B test / evolution proposal | `xninetzy-learning-coach` + `xninetzy-mcp-lightning` | `xninetzy_learning_propose_evolution` + `xninetzy_lightning_*` | `xninetzy_lightning_healthcheck` |

#### Research Mode

| Trigger | Primary skill | MCP entry | Validator |
|---------|---------------|-----------|-----------|
| multi-source research / literature review / fact-check | `xninetzy-deep-research` + `research` + `xninetzy-research-memory` | `xninetzy_research_storm_start` + `xninetzy_research_search` | `research-critic` |
| "tulis paper" + ResearchPacket | `research-paper-writer` / `literature-review-writer` / `scientific-paper-writer` | `xninetzy_research_storm_packet` | `anti-slop` + `citation-validation` |

#### Academic / Assignment Mode

| Trigger | Primary skill | MCP entry | Validator |
|---------|---------------|-----------|-----------|
| HEBAT / Cyber Campus / KRS / UACC / kuesioner (academia) | `xninetzy-assignment-orchestrator` + `xninetzy-academic-safety` + `xninetzy-hebat` (or `xninetzy-cyber-campus`/`xninetzy-krs`/`xninetzy-uacc`) | `xninetzy_harness_plan` + `xninetzy_hebat_sync_assignments` | `submission-readiness` + `anti-slop` |
| tulis paper / draft akademik / edit | `academic-writer` (draft) / `academic-editor` (edit) | `xninetzy_knowledge_answer` | `anti-slop` + `terminology-bank` |

#### Software Engineering Mode

| Trigger | Primary skill | MCP entry | Validator |
