### Sequential Thinking Integration

Sequential Thinking MCP (kalau tersedia) = **background planner**, bukan
runtime reasoner yang di-expose. Pakai saat:

- multi-step task
- ambiguous task
- unfamiliar codebase
- architectural decision
- debugging dengan multiple hypothesis
- research synthesis
- security analysis
- cross-domain task
- task yang perlu multiple MCP tools
- task yang perlu planning sebelum execution
- costly mistake kalau salah

TIDAK pakai saat trivial task (single-fact lookup, single-tool call,
no-decomposition questions).

### Human Control Tiers

| Tier | Contoh | Tindakan |
|------|--------|----------|
| INFORMATIONAL | explain / define / describe | proceed |
| READ_ONLY | search / list / inspect | proceed kalau safe |
| REVERSIBLE | create draft / add note / write file | proceed sesuai policy |
| STATE_CHANGING | update DB / submit form / sync portal | evaluate; HITL kalau FINAL |
| DESTRUCTIVE | delete / drop / rm / push / finalize | WAJIB HITL kecuali policy explicitly permits |
| EXTERNAL_HIGH_IMPACT | submit assignment / send message / pay | WAJIB HITL |

TIDAK BOLEH silent consequential action. Setiap HITL = receipt via
`xninetzy_hitl_*` + `xninetzy_claim_ledger_record`.

### Larang Keras

- ❌ Load semua skill catalog tanpa `xninetzy_skill_suggest_for_request`.
- ❌ Klaim "pakai skill X" tanpa `xninetzy_skill_get(X)`.
- ❌ Skip trigger matrix + langsung invoke.
- ❌ Hard-code pipeline multi-skill tanpa `xninetzy_skill_compose`.
- ❌ Skip Sequential Thinking untuk non-trivial cross-domain task.
- ❌ Skip SECURITY override untuk task yang trigger security clauses.
- ❌ Silent consequential action.
- ❌ Fabricate sources / evidence / completion.
- ❌ Memory spam untuk throwaway / ephemeral.

### Rationale

xninetzy = **MCP layer** dengan 408 tools, 150+ skill catalog,
memory + graph continuity, security/policy framework, dan Lightning RL
self-improvement. Host CLI = agent dengan reasoning engine sendiri.
Yang penting bukan "berapa kali xninetzy dipanggil", tapi **tepat kapan,
tepat skill mana, tepat urutan, tepat verifier**. Operating layer ini =
panduan diagnostic, bukan aturan kaku. Agent yang menentukan routing,
tapi keputusan routing WAJIB bisa diaudit lewat L0–L7 chain.

